    "name": "HealthChat",
    "description": "MLH HackRPI X Winner, HealthChat is a web-based AI application that can answer patients’ questions to help them find the care that they need. The application deploys a chat-based Next.js interface and API which can suggest a specialty physician that is a match for a patient's described issue, as well as find them a doctor who takes their insurance in that specialty in their area.\n\nHealthChat was built using Microsoft’s Bing GPT4 Engine to rapidly search and interpret web results, as well as find sources to back up the answers HealthChat provides. It is deployed on Microsoft Azure and was built using TypeScript, Next.js, and MaterialUI. HealthChat was a winning project at HackRPI X, winning #2 best hack.",
